        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk4-insistence-p03-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "是 / 就是: X就是了: reassure or dismiss further concern",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Action + 就是了 reassures someone that doing this is enough. Depending on tone, it can also dismiss further concern.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "你去就是了。",
                "pinyin": "nǐ qù jiùshì le 。",
                "meaning": "Just go, and that will be enough.",
                "audio": "d4b44df9f336b2f30f490db7335dc281876fc84702554d664617dc197197956f"
              },
              {
                "text": "问他就是了。",
                "pinyin": "wèn tā jiùshì le 。",
                "meaning": "Just ask him; that will settle it.",
                "audio": "c32f22ec2565cb46bca9b429d948aa51b70d661d1d099d9a6413215ae37dd82a"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
